department-Pack = The Pack
department-Pack-description = Independent Nuka-World raiders, slavers and beast keepers. Their colorful animal masks reflect an animalistic hierarchy. They feed their carnivorous beasts human meat, putting them at odds with the Minutemen and Railroad; members unite against larger threats.
