trait-name-PackWarhoundCompanion = Pack Warhound
trait-description-PackWarhoundCompanion = A trained Pack warhound starts by your side and follows without Charisma. Counts toward your follower limit. Available to Hunters and higher ranks.

job-name-pack-shaman = Pack Shaman
job-description-pack-shaman = You are the Pack's healer. Treat your fellow raiders, tend their beasts, and keep the hunt alive. You serve alongside the Beast Tamers, below the Beastmaster.

pack-kit-stalker-name = Pack Stalker
pack-kit-stalker-description = Quiet hunter. Contains: a Pack hunting bow, magnetic arrow quiver, seventeen loose Pack hunting arrows, a refillable bundle of ten reserve arrows, a Pack fang spear, binoculars and a combat knife, two stimpaks, bandages, an MRE box, two bolas and two sets of handcuffs.

pack-kit-champion-name = Pack Champion
pack-kit-champion-description = Frontline defender. Contains: a Paladin shield, Pack bonecrusher club, Pack javelin quiver and four Pack hunting javelins, two stimpaks, bandages, an MRE box, two bolas and two sets of handcuffs.

pack-kit-firehand-name = Pack Fire Hand
pack-kit-firehand-description = Mobile gunslinger. Contains: two Pack Redfang revolvers, a Pack gunslinger belt, four loaded .44 speedloaders and a Pack .44 ammunition box, two stimpaks, bandages, an MRE box, two bolas and two sets of handcuffs.

pack-kit-hunter-name = Pack Hunter
pack-kit-hunter-description = Ranged hunter. Contains: a Pack Longfang rifle, two Pack .308 ammunition boxes, a 9mm pistol, two spare pistol magazines and binoculars, two stimpaks, bandages, an MRE box, two bolas and two sets of handcuffs.

pack-kit-bonebreaker-name = Pack Bone Breaker
pack-kit-bonebreaker-description = Close-range fighter. Contains: a Pack fang machete, Pack bonecrusher club, Psycho and a smoke grenade, two stimpaks, bandages, an MRE box, two bolas and two sets of handcuffs.

pack-kit-painbringer-name = Pack Pain Bringer
pack-kit-painbringer-description = Heavy breacher. Contains: a Pack Thunderjaw shotgun with a twelve-shell internal magazine, two Pack shotgun shell boxes, a Pack fang machete and two smoke grenades, two stimpaks, bandages, an MRE box, two bolas and two sets of handcuffs.

